┏ Rooms ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓┌ Help (q to close) ───────────────────────────────┐
┃  Unread                  ┃│gt                 open the thread of the message │
┃> * #general              ┃│N                  previous match, toward newer me│
┃  * &dev-team             ┃│r                  retry a failed message         │
┃  * @alice                ┃│?                  show what the selected object c│
┃  Folders                 ┃│gr                 show who reacted to the message│
